{"unit_id":"AnakinCao__dsh-md-export#card-zh","repo":"AnakinCao/dsh-md-export","commit":"5619392300540e9e2dc59c5ed3ed87091d09225d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-md-export 是面向 DSH web 的 Markdown 导出扩展，在 dsh-better-sidebar 的 Markdown 工具栏加入导出菜单。它把当前预览内容包装为独立 HTML，可尝试保存到原 Markdown 同目录，失败时改用浏览器下载；也可打开打印对话框另存为 PDF。导出会保留已渲染的正文和 Mermaid 图，并跟随预览主题。适合需要归档或分享侧栏 Markdown 文档的用户；需要 DSH web 和 dsh-better-sidebar。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:330-360","lib/client.js:363-400","lib/client.js:407-470"]}
